# Generated .pokkum/ sandboxes inside test fixtures. Pokkum writes virtual
# configs and patched handlers here during a build; e2e runs leave one
# content-hashed handler per run, so tracking them grows the repo on every
# test run. The deliberate patch-target corpus lives in testdata/adapter-node/.
testdata/fixtures/*/.pokkum/
